  "term": "home and community-based services",
  "definition": "Home and community-based services are supportive services delivered in a person’s home or community, such as homemaking, personal care, adult day care, and medical transportation. In this packet, they are described as part of a broader managed healthcare plan that may also include care coordination and extended care benefits.",
